				575
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁπλοῦς ὁ μῦθος τῆς ἀληθείας ἔφυ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					469
				</span></i>
			: c. part., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νικᾶν . . χρῄζων ἔφυν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					1052
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρέπων ἔφυς . . φωνεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
