			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				4.54
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c.
				inf., <i>to be formed</i> or <i>disposed by
