					1.15c
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> with Preps.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυνὴ . . ἐπὶ</span>
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δακρύοις ἔφυ</span>
			<i>is by nature prone</i> to tears, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Med.</u>
				928
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔρως γὰρ ἀργόν, κἀπὶ τοῖς
