				Id.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				322
			</span></i>; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπί τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					507e
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴς τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.
					3.132
				</span></i>
			; most freq. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρός τι, οἱ ἄνθρωποι πρὸς τὸ ἀληθὲς
					πεφύκασι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					1355a16
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὖ πρὸς ἀρετὴν πεφυκότες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Mem.</u>
					4.1.2
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς πόλεμον μᾶλλον . . ἢ πρὸς
					εἰρήνην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					547e
